.TH WERKMEISTER-REMOVE-WORKSPACE 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-remove\-workspace \- Deprecated: use \fBwerkmeister close\-out \-\-abandon <reason>\fR. Hand off (commit + push) and delete a workspace
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister remove\-workspace\fR <name>
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-y, \-\-yes\fR
Skip the confirmation prompt
.TP
\fB\-\-abandon <reason>\fR
Remove despite unshipped work; records the reason in closeout.md and the PR files
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Deprecated, kept for one release: use \fBwerkmeister close\-out \-\-abandon\fR with a reason.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
